cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Vantage in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Vantage: sensor rig planner for autonomous-driving data collection"
abstract: >-
  Vantage is a desktop application for designing data-collection sensor rigs for autonomous-driving training data:
  cameras, lidars, radars, GNSS antennas and IMUs are placed on a vehicle model in simulation, their coverage,
  resolution, timing, data rates and calibration are analysed, and the rig is checked against live streams and
  recordings before and after the hardware is fitted.
authors:
  - name: "Sherin Joseph Roy"
    website: "https://github.com/Sherin-SEF-AI"
version: "0.6.0"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sherin-SEF-AI/Vantage"
url: "https://sherin-sef-ai.github.io/Vantage/"
keywords:
  - autonomous driving
  - sensor placement
  - camera calibration
  - lidar
  - radar
  - data collection
  - surround view
